Subject: [PATCH] 0285 follow-up: the present tense asks leave to send too
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester's 58066, run 51426: the reply ended „ვუგზავნი ზურაბს გაცნობის
თხოვნას, რომ დაგაკავშიროს თამარ ხუციშვილთან?" with a „კი, გაუგზავნე
თხოვნა" button, and nothing went: the present tense („ვუგზავნი …?")
was not read as asking leave, so the unsent-instruction guard stood
aside. The pattern now covers ვუგზავნი, გავუგზავნი, ვუგზავნო, ვწერ and
ვთხოვ beside the forms 0285 knew. No model-facing text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
